@startuml Linkwise_Chat_Message_Model
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Latin Modern Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #2A9D8F
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 22
skinparam ranksep 28
title UML domain model: messages, copies and evidence (proposed)
class AgentAddress {
 authority_id
 agent_id
 binding_revision
}
class MessageEnvelope {
 version
 message_id
 conversation_id
 in_reply_to
 sender / recipient
 created_at / expires_at
 content_type / payload_length
 payload_digest
}
class StationCopy {
 station_id
 local_state
 accepted_at
 retention_until
}
class TransferAttempt {
 attempt_id / contact_id
 peer_station
 byte_ranges / retry_count
 terminal_reason
}
class Receipt {
 receipt_id / message_id
 kind / issuer_station
 payload_digest
 authenticated_evidence
}
class RouteEvidence {
 route_id / next_hop
 observed_at / valid_until
 eligibility / exclusions
 policy_revision
}
MessageEnvelope --> "2" AgentAddress : sender / recipient
MessageEnvelope "1" -- "1..*" StationCopy : local / relay copies
StationCopy "1" -- "0..*" TransferAttempt
MessageEnvelope "1" -- "0..*" Receipt
TransferAttempt --> RouteEvidence
note bottom of MessageEnvelope
Stable end-to-end envelope; hop metadata is
separate.
A digest detects corruption, not sender
authenticity.
Message bodies have configured size and content-type
limits.
end note
@enduml
